    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play. Trade. Win</h2>Project Stocks is a stock trading simulator that blends strategy, competition, and a touch of market manipulation. This game mirrors the high-stakes environment of the financial world, allowing you a taste of stock market dynamics without any real-world financial risk.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cards</h2>This trading simulator introduces a unique twist with the integration of strategic cards. These cards enable you to tactically sway the market, steal from your opponents, or secure a cash boost during tight moments.<br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207090/extras/89412631b9f85866779379c12279e5fc.poster.avif?t=1699911170\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207090/extras/89412631b9f85866779379c12279e5fc.webm?t=1699911170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207090/extras/89412631b9f85866779379c12279e5fc.mp4?t=1699911170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Upgrade and Excel</h2>Invest in diverse upgrades to sharpen your trading strategies. From accelerating card rates to unlocking insider information, refine your approach and dominate the market with precision.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlock Multiplayer</h2>Purchase DLC to access multiplayer and support the game's ongoing development. Play online with up to seven players or continue in single-player mode against three AI opponents!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play. Trade. Win</h2>Project Stocks is a stock trading simulator that blends strategy, competition, and a touch of market manipulation. This game mirrors the high-stakes environment of the financial world, allowing you a taste of stock market dynamics without any real-world financial risk.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cards</h2>This trading simulator introduces a unique twist with the integration of strategic cards. These cards enable you to tactically sway the market, steal from your opponents, or secure a cash boost during tight moments.<br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207090/extras/89412631b9f85866779379c12279e5fc.poster.avif?t=1699911170\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207090/extras/89412631b9f85866779379c12279e5fc.webm?t=1699911170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207090/extras/89412631b9f85866779379c12279e5fc.mp4?t=1699911170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Upgrade and Excel</h2>Invest in diverse upgrades to sharpen your trading strategies. From accelerating card rates to unlocking insider information, refine your approach and dominate the market with precision.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlock Multiplayer</h2>Purchase DLC to access multiplayer and support the game's ongoing development. Play online with up to seven players or continue in single-player mode against three AI opponents!",
    "short_description": "A darkly humorous and wacky trading simulator. Engage in market manipulation, insider trading, and ruthless deal-making as you battle AI tycoons and human traders. Short, speculate, form alliances, betray, and bend the rules to build your fortune.",
